# AB-036: Equal acid capacities do not imply equal gas production
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CaO 0.0005mol
seal v1 100mL
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CaCO3 0.0005mol
seal v2 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.0012mol
add v2 HCl 0.0012mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
inspect
